<p>The lite archive contains original code, manifests and report fragments, not the lost report or the original damaged delivery. The mechanics were reproduced from those files. C1 historical damage, C6 survivor statistics and C7 original missing block values cannot be independently verified from this attachment; fresh results replace them. The aerodynamic statement tying C_p to a universally necessary tip-speed interval is unproved without a blade model. All turbine parameters in this report are illustrative assumptions.</p>


